00:07:54.123 --> 00:07:55.470
I'll tell you what, it's, you're

00:07:55.470 --> 00:07:56.460
I love that,

00:07:56.460 --> 00:07:57.823
just so that you know,

00:07:59.737 --> 00:08:02.160
you are one of my first
interviews for this record,

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:05.480
and I'm so grateful that
I get to talk to you,

00:08:05.480 --> 00:08:06.820
a fellow recording artist,

00:08:06.820 --> 00:08:08.460
because you'll understand when I say this

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:10.520
more than anyone ever will.

00:08:10.520 --> 00:08:12.670
I've made the greatest
record of my life and,

00:08:12.670 --> 00:08:13.670
