00:08:15.658 --> 00:08:16.491
(applause)

00:08:16.491 --> 00:08:17.324
- Thanks.

00:08:17.324 --> 00:08:18.740
And I came out of a,

00:08:18.740 --> 00:08:21.300
I would say bit of a rough decade.

00:08:21.300 --> 00:08:22.630
The family's been through a lot.

00:08:22.630 --> 00:08:23.880
- Yeah.

00:08:23.880 --> 00:08:24.713
And there were points where

00:08:24.713 --> 00:08:26.750
I don't know how I survived,

00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:30.070
and yet to come out and to have,

00:08:30.070 --> 00:08:32.370
have had this come together.

00:08:32.370 --> 00:08:33.870
I can't believe it's happening.

00:08:33.870 --> 00:08:35.054
And I'm-

00:08:35.054 --> 00:08:35.887
- So these songs are special, yeah.

00:08:35.887 --> 00:08:37.160
- Dude, I need to be in the moment,

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:39.640
and appreciate every moment
of what's gonna happen,

00:08:39.640 --> 00:08:42.483
